    {
      "abstract": "The enhancement factor for (multi-) strange particles in Au+Au $\\sqrt{s_{NN}} = 200$ GeV collisions, where $|y| < 0.5$. The $\\Lambda$, and $\\bar{\\Lambda}$ yields have been feed-down subtracted in all cases. The black bars show the normalization uncertainties, and the uncertainties for the heavy-ion points are the combined statistical and systematic errors. Curves described in the text, where $B_{K} = 2.0$, $B_{\\Lambda} = 2.4$, $B_{\\Xi} = 5.0$ and $B_{\\Omega} = 12.1$.",
